/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T15:59:31-07:00","id":220503,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Hey, Sikla. I've sent you a pm. It has a few ideas I want to share with you. Edit: Thank you for reading and replying to it.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 08-10-2014, 11:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T08:24:34-07:00","id":224134,"title":"","content":"Are we still waiting for Magnusar to post in the IC thread?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T18:31:05-07:00","id":224731,"title":"","content":"I have two questions for you Sikla.<br /> <br /> 1.) Eulalia has the Clairvoyance Merit, here's it's rulings:<br /> <br /> <b>Effect:</b> Your character can project her senses to another<br /> location. She sees, hears, smells, and otherwise experiences<br /> the other place as if she were there. This ability requires a<br /> point of Willpower to activate, successful meditation, and a<br /> Wits + Occult roll.<br /> <b>Suggested Modifiers:</b> Has an object important to the<br /> place (+1), never been there (\u20133), scrying for a person and<br /> not a place (\u20133), scrying for non-specific location (\u20134), spent<br /> significant time there (+2), touching someone with a strong<br /> connection to the place (+1)<br /> <b>Drawback:</b> When choosing this ability, determine how<br /> your character is able to scry. It may be through a crystal<br /> ball, through a drug-induced trance, with esoteric computer<br /> models, or any other method. She cannot scry without that<br /> tool or methodology.<br /> <br /> I'm thinking it would make more sense if Eulalia did this with people primarily, rather than places. So for penalties, places and people could be reversed. In essence, an object important to the person is +1, never known the person is -3, scrying for a place and not a person is -3, scrying for a non-specific person is -4, spent significant time with the person is +2, and touching someone with a strong connection to the person is +1.<br /> <br /> Is that alright, or do I just have to stick with the original rulings?<br /> <br /> 2.) If we're gonna get experiences, how are we gonna do that? Like, how exactly are you gonna give out the beats/experiences?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T18:40:16-07:00","id":224740,"title":"","content":"Crapcarp, as long as you keep it with people, I don't see why you can't switch the modifiers around. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> As for beats, I'll likely be following the suggestions in the GM chronicle rule update book. The way I see it, there's an important scene coming up that'll be the source of y